\f1\fs22 They mingled together. Kathy held hands with Hayley and was happy, in part because she had not replaced her patch since they arrived. She liked the feeling of holding hands with Hayley and liked feeling the feeling. Kathy was a doctor attending a ceremony, a celebration and a wake, holding hands with Hayley who was an investigator attending a ceremony, a celebration and a wake. While they saw different things, what they saw together provided a picture no one else would see.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

